# PowerShell command chaining

PowerShell does NOT support `&&` for command chaining (on this version). Use `;` instead:

- `cd dir; command` — OK
- `cd dir && command` — FAILS (parser error)

Git: pipe diffs through `--no-pager` or redirect to file to avoid blocking on large output:

- `git --no-pager diff <ref1> <ref2> -- file.py`
- `git show <ref>:path > outfile`

Avoid long-running `git diff` commands with no pagination cutoff.
